title="Will GTA 6 on PC Have Ray Tracing, DLSS and Ultrawide Support?",
h1="Will GTA 6 on PC have ray tracing, DLSS and ultrawide support?",
desc="GTA 6 already uses full ray tracing on consoles, and GTA V Enhanced brought ray tracing, DLSS and ultrawide support to PC. Here is what is confirmed, what is only expected, and what it means for your graphics card.",
kicker="Graphics",
lede="GTA 6 is the best looking console game Digital Foundry has ever tested, and ray tracing is the reason why. PC players want to know whether that lighting, plus DLSS and ultrawide support, will carry over to the PC version. The console facts are confirmed. The PC features are not, but Rockstar's last PC release points clearly in one direction.",
