lede="The Steam Deck is the most popular way to play PC games away from a desk, so Deck owners keep asking the same question: can it run GTA 6? Right now the answer is no, not natively, because there is no PC version to install. There is a streaming workaround, and GTA 5's history on the Deck shows exactly what to expect when a PC version finally arrives.",
